config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_GOODWE
	bool "Domoticz plugin: GoodWe solar inverter (SEMS API)"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_REQUESTS
	default n
	help
		read a GoodWe inverter through the SEMS cloud API

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/domoticz-GoodWeSEMS, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		The plugin needs python3-requests (installed as a
		dependency of this package) in addition to the standard library.

		Setup: Setup -> Hardware -> GoodWe, enter the account and station data of the SEMS portal.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE.md is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
